      "description": "Well input on the till. Ice copy, cyan caret, 2px acrylic cut.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field\">Amount (Rs)<input class=\"ds-input\" inputmode=\"numeric\" placeholder=\"0\" /></label>",
      "css": ".ds-field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;font-family:\"Barlow Condensed\",sans-serif;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:0.72rem;color:#c5dbe0}.ds-input{background:#1c2328;color:#d7e6ea;border:1px solid #2c383e;border-radius:2px;padding:8px 10px;font-family:\"Barlow\",sans-serif;font-size:0.92rem;letter-spacing:0.01em;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;caret-color:#1aa3c4}.ds-input::placeholder{color:#7a8a90}.ds-input:hover{border-color:#1aa3c4}.ds-input:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px #0e1418,0 0 0 4px #1aa3c4}"
